        <briefdescription>
<para>Encodes an audio source into a Node object. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This function takes in a reference to an AudioSource and encodes it into a Node object. The encoded data is then pushed back onto the Node object.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>rhs</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>A reference to an AudioSource that needs to be encoded. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
